<p> Maize     3,768   26.5 (28.8)     n/a    n/a   (n/a)    (n/a)</p>
<p> Soybeans    n/a    n/a  (n/a)     n/a    n/a   (n/a)    (n/a)</p>
<p> Sunflower 2,957    7.9  (6.4)     n/a    n/a   (n/a)    (n/a)</p>
